{"id":"vod_sn_36326","vodId":"36326","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"监狱学园","name_cn":"监狱学园","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/13298070c9834cdb9ea1ef3fb21617ec.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在位于东京郊外的私立八光学园之中，这所学校致力于培养高贵纯洁的千金大小姐并因此远近闻名。然而，令众人都无法相信的是，自2011年4月起，这所从未被男子所踏足过的圣殿，竟然开始招收男生，而以藤野清志（中川大志 饰）为首的五个男生成为了这所学校历史上的首批男子学员。　　在诸葛岳人（柄本时生 饰）、若本真吾（矢野圣人 饰）、安德烈（坂本祐介 饰）和根津让二（宫城大树 饰）的怂恿之下，藤野清志决定和他们一同去偷窥女澡堂，然而很快就落网的四人当然遭受到了来自于校园内部神秘组织“里学生会”的惩罚。他们被监禁在“监狱”之中，每日都要受到会长栗园万里（山崎紘菜 饰）等学生会骨干的“折磨”和“蹂躏”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i4GxiX2TuB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BThkcURf4c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qbnxLnG3BZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uBPaTpPNHE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/k92Ddi5yZk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JqT5sJJCd31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0vf53dHK1d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TrvWW5WtF81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kfixPHXtbm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JYg1xFmczc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zSmP2ykBLz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XqFjYnSPtu1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.162Z"}